# fastlane Appfile — Android (Google Play).
# https://docs.fastlane.tools/advanced/#appfile
#
# The package name matches the release applicationId wired in
# app/build.gradle.kts (WS-4.5) and the iOS bundle id (ai.kali.mobile).
#
# The Play Console service-account credentials are NOT stored here. `supply`
# reads them from the PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON env/secret at runtime (see the
# Fastfile), so no key path is hardcoded.

